          "source": "Tatoeba #12325456 @mhr / #6106635 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12325456",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "zoo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13875511",
          "text": "Im Zoo sind Tiere.",
          "translation": "В зоопарке звери.",
