          "source": "Tatoeba #135 @MUIRIEL / #5467 @Eldad (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/135",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "zusammenhang-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1239700",
          "text": "Das Zitat ist aus dem Zusammenhang gerissen.",
