          "text": "Der Anfang ist am wichtigsten.",
          "translation": "Начало важнее всего.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13881036 @Biderl / #13881042 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13881036",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "wichtigsten-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6803563",
          "text": "Ich lese die wichtigsten Zeitungen.",
          "translation": "Я читаю самые важные газеты.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6803563 @rmateo / #6808314 @Swetlanaw (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6803563",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "wichtigsten-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12133187",
          "text": "Was ist für dich am wichtigsten?",
          "translation": "Что для тебя важнее всего?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12133187 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #5998400 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12133187",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "wichtigsten-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3541270",
          "text": "Du hast eine der wichtigsten Regeln verletzt.",
          "translation": "Ты нарушил одно из самых важных правил.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3541270 @al_ex_an_der / #3541275 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3541270",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "wichtigsten-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
