          "text": "Wehe den Besiegten.",
          "translation": "Горе побеждённым.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #532547 @samueldora / #598941 @kobylkin (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/532547",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
