          "translation": "Звонили все телефоны.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6303935 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #6921238 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6303935",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sämtliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2093660",
          "text": "Du überschreitest sämtliche Grenzen.",
          "translation": "Ты переходишь все границы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2093660 @al_ex_an_der / #2091792 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2093660",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sämtliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "759349",
          "text": "Kannst du sämtliche Dokumente zusammensuchen?",
          "translation": "Ты можешь собрать все документы?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #759349 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #4881283 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/759349",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sämtliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13399971",
          "text": "Man muß nicht sämtliche Mücken erschlagen.",
          "translation": "Необязательно убивать всех комаров.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13399971 @Waldelfe / #12187493 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13399971",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sämtliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3371334",
          "text": "Ich vergaß, sämtliche Fenster zu schließen.",
          "translation": "Я забыл закрыть все окна.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3371334 @al_ex_an_der / #3371314 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3371334",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sämtliche-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
