          "source": "Tatoeba #1709886 @Zaghawa / #3668101 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1709886",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "zwanzig-num"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4706678",
          "text": "Er hat zwanzig Kinder.",
          "translation": "У него двадцать детей.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4706678 @bonny37 / #4706825 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4706678",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
