          "id": "6856278",
          "text": "Bitte räume das Essgeschirr ab!",
          "translation": "Пожалуйста, убери посуду!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6856278 @list / #6859318 @alik_farber (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6856278",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
