          "source": "Tatoeba #1820345 @Tamy / #5222331 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1820345",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fischen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1822010",
          "text": "Mein Onkel geht gerne Fischen.",
          "translation": "Мой дядя любит ходить на рыбалку.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1822010 @Tamy / #5049361 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1822010",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fischen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "368224",
          "text": "Vater ist zum Fischen gegangen.",
          "translation": "Отец ушёл на рыбалку.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #368224 @lilygilder / #1558585 @ABChessel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/368224",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
