          "source": "Tatoeba #9176885 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #7135403 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9176885",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fischen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2375645",
          "text": "Ich interessiere mich sehr fürs Fischen.",
          "translation": "Я очень интересуюсь рыбалкой.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2375645 @Zaghawa / #443932 @Hellerick (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2375645",
