          "text": "Ein maßloses Leben führt ins Elend.",
          "translation": "Неумеренная жизнь приводит к беде.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #651326 @kolonjano / #651060 @salikh (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/651326",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "elend-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "518620",
          "text": "Krieg wird von Elend und Trauer begleitet.",
          "translation": "Спутники войны - это нищета и скорбь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #518620 @xtofu80 / #1992920 @mrtaistoi (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/518620",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "elend-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
        "article": "das",
        "nominative_sg": "das Elend",
        "nominative_pl": ""
      }
