          "source": "Tatoeba #2230160 @al_ex_an_der / #4956688 @Afonkin (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2230160",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "frosch-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3245549",
          "text": "Der Frosch wurde ein Prinz.",
