          "source": "Tatoeba #1496800 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #5888314 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1496800",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ass-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13922162",
          "text": "Er aß Fleisch.",
          "translation": "Он поел мяса.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13922162 @mhr / #13922171 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13922162",
