        },
        {
          "id": "12612796",
          "text": "Ich sah im Fenster eine weibliche Silhouette.",
          "translation": "Я видел в окне женский силуэт.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12612796 @Waldelfe / #12612634 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12612796",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "weibliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13655699",
          "text": "Männliche Hirsche haben Hörner, aber weibliche nicht.",
          "translation": "У самцов оленей есть рога, а у самок — нет.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13655699 @Naina / #13655725 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13655699",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "weibliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3711098",
          "text": "Deutschlands einzige weibliche Billardmeisterin ist eine Türkin.",
          "translation": "Единственная топ-бильярдистка Германии — турчанка.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3711098 @brauchinet / #4108924 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3711098",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "weibliche-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1104751",
          "text": "In dieser Zeit gab es sehr wenige weibliche Ärzte.",
          "translation": "В те времена женщин-врачей было очень мало.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1104751 @Haehnchenpaella / #4955452 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1104751",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "weibliche-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
