          "translation": "«Leicester» произносится «Lester» (Лестер).",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10675068 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #10019464 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10675068",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ausgesprochen-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3013101",
          "text": "Die Wahrheit, offen ausgesprochen, schmerzt.",
          "translation": "Прямо высказанная правда колет.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3013101 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #3034807 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3013101",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ausgesprochen-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "14078252",
          "text": "Ich weiß, wie es ausgesprochen wird.",
          "translation": "Я знаю, как оно произносится.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #14078252 @mhr / #14078234 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14078252",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ausgesprochen-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6140334",
          "text": "Du hast alle Wörter falsch ausgesprochen.",
          "translation": "Ты все слова произнёс неправильно.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6140334 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #6130083 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6140334",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ausgesprochen-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6140345",
          "text": "Hat er dieses Wort richtig ausgesprochen?",
          "translation": "Он правильно произнёс это слово?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6140345 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #6130077 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6140345",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ausgesprochen-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
