          "source": "Tatoeba #916088 @Fingerhut / #1576831 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/916088",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "regelmässig-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7830305",
          "text": "Trinken Sie regelmäßig Alkohol?",
          "translation": "Вы регулярно употребляете алкоголь?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7830305 @list / #13050241 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7830305",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "regelmässig-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3622561",
          "text": "Ich schreibe regelmäßig Artikel.",
