          "source": "Tatoeba #1947995 @Alois / #2659127 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1947995",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "aufbrechen-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "657409",
          "text": "Wir werden in einer Stunde aufbrechen.",
          "translation": "Мы уезжаем через час.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #657409 @Zaghawa / #523485 @elsteris (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/657409",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "aufbrechen-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4141793",
          "text": "Wir sind uns darin einig, dass wir früh aufbrechen müssen.",
          "translation": "Мы сходимся на том, что должны рано выехать.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4141793 @raggione / #4141911 @AqQoyriq_1 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4141793",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
