    {
      "slug": "angemessen-verb",
      "lemma": "angemessen",
      "pos": "verb",
      "language": "de",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 6069,
      "frequency_band": "goethe-c1",
      "translations": {
        "en": [
          "past participle of anmessen"
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "2943469",
          "text": "Sie müssen die Ergebnisse des eigenen Handelns angemessen beurteilen.",
          "translation": "Вам нужно адекватно оценивать результаты своей деятельности.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2943469 @al_ex_an_der / #2943467 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2943469",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "angemessen-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2943474",
          "text": "Dieses Wissen ist erforderlich, um die Situation angemessen zu beurteilen.",
          "translation": "Это знание нужно для адекватной оценки ситуации.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2943474 @al_ex_an_der / #2943472 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2943474",
