          "text": "Kinder müssen geschützt werden.",
          "translation": "Нужно защищать детей.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13442121 @Waldelfe / #13098919 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13442121",
