          "source": "Tatoeba #452679 @al_ex_an_der / #6162440 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/452679",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "schmidt-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1811933",
          "text": "Ist Herr Schmidt gerade zu Hause?",
