          "source": "Tatoeba #749709 @Manfredo / #2260918 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/749709",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "löffel-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8362597",
          "text": "Das ist ein Löffel.",
          "translation": "Это ложка.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8362597 @Adelpa / #3622896 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8362597",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "löffel-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "662762",
          "text": "Es fehlt ein Löffel.",
          "translation": "Не хватает ложки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #662762 @bluepie88 / #1971170 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/662762",
