          "text": "Der Hahn schrie die ganze Nacht lang.",
          "translation": "Петух кричал всю ночь напролёт.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2042177 @al_ex_an_der / #2043670 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2042177",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "hahn-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13396296",
          "text": "Ich habe viele Hennen, aber keinen Hahn.",
          "translation": "У меня много кур, но нет петуха.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13396296 @Waldelfe / #6798792 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13396296",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "hahn-name"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
        "article": "der",
        "nominative_sg": "der Hahn",
        "nominative_pl": ""
      }
