          "text": "Tom hasste Mary.",
          "translation": "Том ненавидел Мэри.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4943176 @Hans_Adler / #2370523 @corvard (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4943176",
