    {
      "slug": "z-character",
      "lemma": "z",
      "pos": "character",
      "language": "de",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 6545,
      "frequency_band": "goethe-c1",
      "translations": {
        "en": [
          "The twenty-sixth and last letter of the German alphabet, written in the Latin script."
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "3013788",
          "text": "In Argentinien wird z wie s ausgesprochen.",
          "translation": "В Аргентине \"z\" произносится так же, как и \"s\".",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3013788 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #3013783 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3013788",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "z-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "396341",
          "text": "Manche Tiere, wie z.B. Tiger, essen Fleisch.",
          "translation": "Многие животные, как, например, тигр, едят мясо.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #396341 @xtofu80 / #4359584 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/396341",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "z-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "432659",
          "text": "Es fehlt z.B. die Option: „nur mit dieser Wortgruppe“.",
          "translation": "Например, не хватает функции \"только с этим словосочетанием\".",
          "source": "Tatoeba #432659 @opti / #432662 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/432659",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "z-character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "651153",
          "text": "In Italien gibt es viele alte Städte, z.B. Rom und Venedig.",
          "translation": "В Италии находятся многие древние города. Например, Рим и Венеция.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #651153 @Hans07 / #650590 @Maksimo (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/651153",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "z-character"
          ]
        }
      ],
