          "text": "Überlass das Reden ihm.",
          "translation": "Говорит пусть он.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11827553 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #14112075 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11827553",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
