          "source": "Tatoeba #9199111 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #4535858 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9199111",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "toni-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7062141",
          "text": "Toni liebt Maria voll und ganz.",
          "translation": "Тони влюблён в Марию по уши.",
