          "id": "13889614",
          "text": "Schiesst uns ins Finale.",
          "translation": "Выведите нас в финал.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13889614 @carlosalberto / #13889632 @carlosalberto (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13889614",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
