          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jeans-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "784274",
          "text": "Ich trage am Sonntag gewöhnlich Jeans.",
          "translation": "По воскресеньям я обычно ношу джинсы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #784274 @al_ex_an_der / #4584099 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/784274",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
