          "id": "1952689",
          "text": "Dir werde ich helfen, Freundchen!",
          "translation": "Я помогу тебе, дружище!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1952689 @al_ex_an_der / #5515649 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1952689",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
