          "text": "Seine Brille ist zerbrochen.",
          "translation": "Его очки сломаны.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6615929 @list / #6948214 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6615929",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
