          "source": "Tatoeba #10194085 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #10194012 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10194085",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jegliche-unknown"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3059099",
          "text": "Ich beantworte gern jegliche weiteren Fragen.",
          "translation": "Я с удовольствием отвечу на любые дополнительные вопросы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3059099 @al_ex_an_der / #3059094 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3059099",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jegliche-unknown"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12900668",
          "text": "Esperanto ist sehr viel leichter als jegliche natürliche Sprache.",
          "translation": "Эсперанто намного легче любого естественного языка.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12900668 @Waldelfe / #5296240 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12900668",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jegliche-unknown"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8090535",
          "text": "Wir wollen sehen, ob wir das ohne jegliche Hilfe schaffen!",
          "translation": "Посмотрим, сможем ли мы сделать это без какой-либо помощи.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8090535 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #8090496 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8090535",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jegliche-unknown"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
