          "source": "Tatoeba #13828469 @mhr / #13828626 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13828469",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ressourcen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "345246",
          "text": "China ist reich an natürlichen Ressourcen.",
          "translation": "Китай богат природными ресурсами.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #345246 @MUIRIEL / #407911 @Wadimiy (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/345246",
