        },
        {
          "id": "8080377",
          "text": "Lach, so oft es geht!",
          "translation": "Смейся как можно чаще.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8080377 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #8080345 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8080377",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "lach-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "342806",
          "text": "Lach bitte nicht über mich.",
          "translation": "Не смейся надо мной, пожалуйста.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #342806 @MUIRIEL / #4414255 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/342806",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
