          "text": "Wo ist der Schenk?",
          "translation": "Где бармен?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8190790 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #2505485 @paul_lingvo (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8190790",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
