          "source": "Tatoeba #13633494 @mhr / #5713871 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13633494",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "schenk-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13633489",
          "text": "Schenk dem Feind einen Fernseher!",
          "translation": "Подари врагу телевизор.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13633489 @mhr / #11086154 @soweli_Elepanto (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13633489",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "schenk-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4559684",
          "text": "Schenk mir in mein Glas ein wenig Wein ein.",
          "translation": "Налей мне в бокал немного вина.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4559684 @Juri / #4371898 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4559684",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
