          "source": "Tatoeba #6402213 @Hannivar / #6361283 @astru (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6402213",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "institut-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2441569",
          "text": "In unserem Institut sind mehr als achtzig Mitarbeiter beschäftigt.",
          "translation": "В нашем институте занято более восьмидесяти сотрудников.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2441569 @al_ex_an_der / #2441568 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2441569",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "institut-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
        "article": "das",
        "nominative_sg": "das Institut",
        "nominative_pl": ""
      }
