          "source": "Tatoeba #13972087 @rul / #13971830 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13972087",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "rühr-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4986077",
          "text": "Rühr meine Sachen nie mehr an.",
          "translation": "Больше никогда не прикасайся к моим вещам.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4986077 @al_ex_an_der / #4986097 @alik_farber (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4986077",
