          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "riefen-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1875920",
          "text": "Sie riefen den Psychiater an und fragten, was sie tun sollen.",
          "translation": "Они позвонили психиатру и спросили, что делать.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1875920 @Esperantostern / #10987094 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1875920",
