          "text": "Wie übersetzt man Ironie?",
          "translation": "Как перевести иронию?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13809796 @mhr / #13809805 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13809796",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
