          "source": "Tatoeba #1137133 @Esperantostern / #10118439 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1137133",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "käfer-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7881648",
          "text": "Er beobachtet den Käfer.",
