          "source": "Tatoeba #360629 @Wolf / #1554161 @Biga (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/360629",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "rotes-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "750330",
          "text": "Du hast ein rotes Gesicht.",
