          "translation": "У него было железное алиби.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #576162 @cost / #2356413 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/576162",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "starkes-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1946687",
          "text": "Tom hat ein starkes Verantwortungsbewusstsein.",
          "translation": "У Тома сильное чувство ответственности.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1946687 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #3008146 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1946687",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "starkes-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1937027",
          "text": "Ein Elefant ist ein starkes Tier.",
          "translation": "Слон - сильное животное.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1937027 @Esperantostern / #3003110 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1937027",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "starkes-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11587945",
          "text": "Liebe ist ein sehr starkes Gefühl.",
          "translation": "Любовь очень сильное чувство.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11587945 @carlosalberto / #11866002 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11587945",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "starkes-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2904078",
          "text": "Das ist ein sehr starkes Schlafmittel.",
          "translation": "Это очень сильное снотворное.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2904078 @al_ex_an_der / #2906524 @Wezzel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2904078",
