          "source": "Tatoeba #565751 @al_ex_an_der / #2657590 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/565751",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "landete-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "636467",
          "text": "Der Flieger landete sicher.",
          "translation": "Самолёт благополучно приземлился.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #636467 @Manfredo / #6479326 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/636467",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
