          "id": "13982465",
          "text": "Ich bin in Ohio.",
          "translation": "Я в Огайо.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13982465 @Rovo / #13982162 @EugeneGS (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13982465",
