          "source": "Tatoeba #12511939 @Naina / #14115107 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12511939",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "parfüm-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10052128",
          "text": "Ich habe meiner Mutter ein Parfüm geschenkt.",
          "translation": "Я подарил маме духи.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10052128 @felix63 / #11692053 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10052128",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "parfüm-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4933740",
          "text": "Dieses Parfüm hinterlässt auf der Haut ein angenehmes Gefühl von Zartheit.",
          "translation": "Этот лосьон оставляет на коже приятное ощущение мягкости.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4933740 @al_ex_an_der / #4934002 @Afonkin (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4933740",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
