          "source": "Tatoeba #2847831 @kaktuswasser / #2843694 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2847831",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gehängt-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3866138",
          "text": "Tom hat sein Diplom an die Wand gehängt.",
          "translation": "Том повесил свой диплом на стену.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3866138 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #3866029 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3866138",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gehängt-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13854268",
          "text": "Warum hast du es in den Schrank gehängt?",
          "translation": "Зачем ты повесил его в шкаф?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13854268 @mhr / #10290957 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13854268",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
