          "translation": "Я научу тебя шить.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12640051 @Waldelfe / #14064932 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12640051",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "nähen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12640052",
          "text": "Ich werde euch das Nähen beibringen.",
          "translation": "Я научу вас шить.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12640052 @Waldelfe / #14064933 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12640052",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "nähen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1692778",
          "text": "Maria versteht nichts vom Nähen oder Stricken.",
          "translation": "Мэри не разбирается ни в шитье, ни в вязании.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1692778 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #11456123 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1692778",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "nähen-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
        "article": "das",
        "nominative_sg": "das Nähen",
        "nominative_pl": ""
      }
