        {
          "id": "1219588",
          "text": "Wir müssen die Ampel beachten.",
          "translation": "Мы должны уделять внимание сигналам светофора.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1219588 @PeterR / #2597662 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1219588",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "beachten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11272624",
          "text": "Die Frauen beachten sie nicht.",
          "translation": "Женщины не обращают на неё внимания.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11272624 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #11272629 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11272624",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "beachten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "14088145",
          "text": "Jedes Team muss die Regeln beachten.",
          "translation": "Каждая команда должна соблюдать правила.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #14088145 @felix63 / #14089113 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14088145",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "beachten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2262350",
          "text": "Die Fahrer müssen die Straßenverkehrsordnung beachten.",
          "translation": "Водители должны соблюдать правила дорожного движения.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2262350 @Zaghawa / #3020395 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2262350",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "beachten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5881195",
          "text": "Er schrieb weiter, ohne mich zu beachten.",
          "translation": "Он продолжал писать, не обращая на меня внимания.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5881195 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #5877493 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5881195",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "beachten-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
