          "source": "Tatoeba #13470738 @mhr / #13470523 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13470738",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "läden-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2753166",
          "text": "Die meisten Läden waren geschlossen.",
          "translation": "Большинство магазинов были закрыты.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2753166 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #3050383 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2753166",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "läden-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12785539",
          "text": "Hier gibt es viele kleine Läden.",
          "translation": "Здесь много маленьких магазинчиков.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12785539 @Waldelfe / #12785552 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12785539",
