          "source": "Tatoeba #4778678 @Tamy / #2553954 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4778678",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "mochten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4778689",
          "text": "Sie mochten dieses Spiel.",
          "translation": "Вам нравилась эта игра.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4778689 @Tamy / #2553937 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4778689",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "mochten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8897798",
          "text": "Viele Leute mochten Tom nicht.",
          "translation": "Тома многие не любили.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8897798 @mramosch / #8906943 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8897798",
