          "text": "Die sieben Zwerge waren die neue Familie der Königstochter.",
          "translation": "Семь гномов были новой семьёй принцессы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12179903 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #4504230 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12179903",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "zwerge-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "788181",
          "text": "Wenn die Sonne der Kultur tief steht, werfen selbst Zwerge große Schatten.",
          "translation": "Когда солнце культуры заходит, то даже гномы отбрасывают большие тени.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #788181 @BraveSentry / #2873931 @sigavax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/788181",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "zwerge-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3446322",
          "text": "Zwerge nannten Mithril \"das wahre Silber\".",
          "translation": "Гномы называли мифрил \"истинное серебро\".",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3446322 @sigavax / #3435609 @sigavax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3446322",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "zwerge-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
        "article": "",
        "nominative_sg": "",
        "nominative_pl": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "trösten-verb",
      "lemma": "trösten",
      "pos": "verb",
      "language": "de",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 8194,
      "frequency_band": "goethe-c1",
      "translations": {
        "ru": [
          "утешать"
        ],
        "en": [
          "to console, to comfort, to support someone (emotionally)"
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "1709382",
          "text": "Wir trösten seine Mutter.",
          "translation": "Мы утешаем его мать.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1709382 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #6616134 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1709382",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "trösten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2346653",
          "text": "Er versuchte, sie zu trösten.",
          "translation": "Он пытался её утешить.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2346653 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #2346657 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2346653",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "trösten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13728894",
          "text": "Sie weinte und weinte, aber niemand kam, um sie zu trösten.",
          "translation": "Она плакала и плакала, но никто не пришёл, чтобы её утешить.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13728894 @Waldelfe / #1585942 @ABChessel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13728894",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "trösten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "14096119",
          "text": "Man kann sich damit trösten, dass niemand ums Leben gekommen ist.",
          "translation": "Можно утешаться тем, что никто не умер.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #14096119 @mhr / #14095966 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14096119",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "trösten-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "14096121",
          "text": "Man konnte sich damit trösten, dass niemand ums Leben gekommen war.",
          "translation": "Можно было утешаться тем, что никто не умер.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #14096121 @mhr / #14095962 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14096121",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "trösten-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "german": {
        "article": "",
        "nominative_sg": "",
        "nominative_pl": ""
      }
