          "source": "Tatoeba #8329759 @Adelpa / #2678643 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8329759",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "wang-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13947379",
          "text": "Ich heiße Wang Ming.",
          "translation": "Меня зовут 王明.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13947379 @mhr / #13947224 @Adelpa (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13947379",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
