          "source": "Tatoeba #13564845 @Waldelfe / #13564853 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13564845",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jahreszeit-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "732662",
          "text": "Es ist die beste Jahreszeit.",
          "translation": "Это лучшее время года.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #732662 @Dejo / #4057787 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/732662",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "jahreszeit-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2927926",
          "text": "Sommer ist die heißeste Jahreszeit.",
          "translation": "Лето — самое жаркое время года.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2927926 @Zaghawa / #2817391 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2927926",
