          "id": "3332592",
          "text": "Tom lächelt nie.",
          "translation": "Том никогда не улыбается.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3332592 @Serafettin / #3022260 @sharptoothed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3332592",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
