          "source": "Tatoeba #11684806 @mhr / #2832792 @AqQoyriq (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11684806",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "erwacht-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2035166",
          "text": "Sie erwacht um sieben Uhr.",
          "translation": "Она просыпается в семь часов.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2035166 @Tamy / #4945238 @Afonkin (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2035166",
