          "source": "Tatoeba #1081062 @Eldad / #4487599 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1081062",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "erwacht-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12427575",
          "text": "Er ist aus dem Koma erwacht.",
          "translation": "Он вышел из комы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12427575 @Waldelfe / #7950896 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12427575",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "erwacht-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3406733",
          "text": "Tom erwacht aus einem tiefen Schlaf.",
          "translation": "Том пробуждается от глубокого сна.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3406733 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #1566955 @corvard (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3406733",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
