          "source": "Tatoeba #5809836 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #13026397 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5809836",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "lebenslauf-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1515809",
          "text": "Ihr Lebenslauf hat mich wirklich beeindruckt.",
