          "source": "Tatoeba #9090342 @Luiaard / #13353861 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9090342",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "rudel-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13396399",
          "text": "Eine Gruppe von Wölfen ist ein Rudel.",
          "translation": "Группа волков — это стая.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13396399 @Vortarulo / #13397032 @carlosalberto (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13396399",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
