          "text": "Das ist reine Poesie.",
          "translation": "Это чистая поэзия.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6549606 @carlosalberto / #6548840 @astru (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6549606",
