          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sinkt-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13294312",
          "text": "Die Temperatur draußen sinkt langsam.",
          "translation": "Температура на улице медленно снижается.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13294312 @mraz / #13293433 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13294312",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sinkt-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13875943",
          "text": "Der Wasserpegel in den Kanälen sinkt.",
