          "source": "Tatoeba #7832688 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #7832813 @Svetislava (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7832688",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "donnerwetter-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "376",
          "text": "Donnerwetter! Das ist nicht schlecht!",
          "translation": "Черт подери! Это неплохо!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #376 @MUIRIEL / #976638 @redscorp (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/376",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
