          "id": "712333",
          "text": "Er ist kein gewöhnlicher Student.",
          "translation": "Он не обычный студент.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #712333 @conker / #583597 @loins (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/712333",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
