          "id": "1453159",
          "text": "Ein neuer Besen kehrt gut.",
          "translation": "Новая метла чисто метёт.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1453159 @Esperantostern / #423270 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1453159",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "besen-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6804283",
          "text": "Wir fegen mit einem Besen.",
          "translation": "Мы подметаем метлой.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6804283 @manese / #6804508 @alik_farber (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6804283",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "besen-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
