          "source": "Tatoeba #14069614 @mhr / #14069749 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14069614",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "vernünftige-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3000749",
          "text": "Meine Großmutter hatte sehr vernünftige Ansichten.",
