          "source": "Tatoeba #11142706 @mutskt / #3059771 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11142706",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "magazine-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "481854",
          "text": "Solche Magazine haben einen großen Einfluss auf Kinder.",
          "translation": "Такие журналы имеют большое влияние на детей.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #481854 @Espi / #1794282 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/481854",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
