          "to state, supply, give, report (data, e.g. one’s details in a form, an answer in a survey, a source for a quote)",
          "to indicate, specify",
          "to show, represent"
        ]
      },
      "gender": null,
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "3162240",
          "text": "Sie müssen ihr Alter und ihr Geschlecht angeben.",
          "translation": "Вы должны указать свой возраст и пол.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3162240 @al_ex_an_der / #3179936 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3162240",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "angeben-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2358299",
          "text": "Man kann auch eine weitere einzuladende Person angeben.",
          "translation": "Можно указать ещё человека, достойного приглашения.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2358299 @al_ex_an_der / #2370433 @corvard (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2358299",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "angeben-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1927364",
          "text": "Ich will ja nicht angeben, aber ich schwimme schon ohne Schwimmflügel!",
          "translation": "Не хочу хвастать, но я уже плаваю без нарукавников.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1927364 @Esperantostern / #4372149 @mrtaistoi (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1927364",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "angeben-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4124989",
          "text": "Wir leben hier in einem Land, in dem Narren den Ton angeben.",
          "translation": "Мы живём в такой стране, где тон задают дураки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4124989 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #4126534 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4124989",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "angeben-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
