          "text": "Entweder Caesar oder nichts.",
          "translation": "Или Цезарь, или ничего.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #527118 @jxan / #5822037 @astru (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/527118",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
