          "text": "Sie raucht gerne Tabak.",
          "translation": "Она любит курить табак.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #782247 @Chris / #4935773 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/782247",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
