          "source": "Tatoeba #4145050 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #4145099 @AqQoyriq_1 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4145050",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "element-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1639979",
          "text": "Wasserstoff ist das leichteste Element.",
          "translation": "Водород — самый лёгкий элемент.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1639979 @Zaghawa / #4539092 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1639979",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "element-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13810550",
          "text": "Fluor ist ein hochreaktives chemisches Element.",
          "translation": "Фтор — высокореактивный химический элемент.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13810550 @mhr / #13810523 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13810550",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "element-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1985404",
          "text": "Der Kohlenstoff ist das tragende Element des Lebens.",
          "translation": "Углерод - основной элемент живых организмов.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1985404 @Alois / #7470131 @alik_farber (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1985404",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "element-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12484823",
          "text": "Platin ist ein chemisches Element mit dem Symbol Pt.",
          "translation": "Платина — химический элемент, который обозначается символом Pt.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12484823 @Yorwba / #5491883 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12484823",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "element-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki de (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
