          "source": "Tatoeba #2663818 @al_ex_an_der / #5194694 @Svetislava (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2663818",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "verdiente-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7637082",
          "text": "Tom bekam, was er verdiente.",
          "translation": "Том получил по заслугам.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7637082 @wolfgangth / #4258698 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7637082",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "verdiente-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "620688",
          "text": "Sein Verbrechen verdiente die Todesstrafe.",
          "translation": "Его преступление заслуживало смертной казни.",
