          "source": "Tatoeba #12406910 @Waldelfe / #12407079 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12406910",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "verbiete-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "404898",
          "text": "Ich verbiete dir zu rauchen.",
          "translation": "Я запрещаю тебе курить.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #404898 @xtofu80 / #1903499 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/404898",
