          "id": "7712332",
          "text": "Sie gab eine vage Antwort.",
          "translation": "Она дала расплывчатый ответ.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7712332 @wolfgangth / #7882694 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7712332",
