          "text": "Wir sind gierig.",
          "translation": "Мы жадные.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3766270 @Jens_Odo / #3334566 @Biga (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3766270",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gierig-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6370502",
          "text": "Tom war nie gierig.",
          "translation": "Том никогда не был жадным.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6370502 @al_ex_an_der / #5573892 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6370502",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gierig-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1224543",
          "text": "Die Menschen sind gierig.",
          "translation": "Люди жадные.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1224543 @Pfirsichbaeumchen / #6995866 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1224543",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gierig-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2981016",
          "text": "Er ist gierig und faul.",
          "translation": "Он жадный и ленивый.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2981016 @pne / #2282916 @Lenin_1917 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2981016",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gierig-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2583339",
          "text": "Gierig verschlang Tom eine ganze Quarktorte.",
          "translation": "Том с жадностью сожрал творожный торт целиком.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2583339 @al_ex_an_der / #2583337 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2583339",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gierig-adj"
          ]
        }
