          "id": "8433188",
          "text": "Ihm sei Ehre dafür und Lob.",
          "translation": "Честь ему за это и хвала.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8433188 @faehrmann / #8433084 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8433188",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
